{"seq":1,"slug":"why-canvas-webgl","title":"为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/why-canvas-webgl","wordCount":1755,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何需要-canvas-与-webgl\">为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL</h1><p>一个交易看板要在同一屏里实时刷新八千个报价格子，颜色随价格跳动；一个白板应用要让用户拖拽上万个矢量图元还保持跟手；一个图像编辑器要对四千万像素做一次卷积模糊。这三件事有一个共同点：用 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> 堆出来的方案会在第一帧就卡死。它们逼着前端离开熟悉的 DOM，走向一块空白画布。理解「为什么」，比记住任何一个 Canvas API 都重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-即时模式与保留模式\">核心概念：即时模式与保留模式</h2><p>DOM 是一种<strong>保留模式</strong>（retained mode）图形系统：你描述一棵元素树，浏览器把这棵树「保留」在内存里，替你负责布局、绘制、事件命中、无障碍树、以及在你改动某个节点时精确地重新渲染受影响的部分。你操纵的是对象，不是像素。</p>\n<p>Canvas 2D 与 WebGL 是<strong>即时模式</strong>（immediate mode）图形系统：你发出一条条绘制指令，画布立刻在像素上执行，执行完就把「这是什么」彻底忘记。画布不知道自己上面有一个「按钮」或「一条曲线」，它只知道某些像素现在是某种颜色。要改动画面，你得自己清空、自己重画。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[你的数据/状态] --&gt; B{图形模型}&#10;  B --&gt;|保留模式 DOM| C[描述元素树&lt;br/&gt;浏览器保管对象]&#10;  B --&gt;|即时模式 Canvas/WebGL| D[发出绘制指令&lt;br/&gt;直接落到像素]&#10;  C --&gt; E[浏览器负责布局&lt;br/&gt;重绘/合成/命中/无障碍]&#10;  D --&gt; F[你负责清空&lt;br/&gt;重画/命中检测/无障碍]&#10;  E --&gt; G[省心 但每元素有对象开销]&#10;  F --&gt; H[全手工 但没有对象开销]\">flowchart TD\n  A[你的数据/状态] --&gt; B{图形模型}\n  B --&gt;|保留模式 DOM| C[描述元素树&lt;br/&gt;浏览器保管对象]\n  B --&gt;|即时模式 Canvas/WebGL| D[发出绘制指令&lt;br/&gt;直接落到像素]\n  C --&gt; E[浏览器负责布局&lt;br/&gt;重绘/合成/命中/无障碍]\n  D --&gt; F[你负责清空&lt;br/&gt;重画/命中检测/无障碍]\n  E --&gt; G[省心 但每元素有对象开销]\n  F --&gt; H[全手工 但没有对象开销]</pre><p>这一对概念是整个 hub 的思想基石。保留模式用「浏览器替你管理每个对象」换取开发的省心，代价是每个对象都要占内存、进布局、进合成，元素一多开销就线性甚至超线性上涨。即时模式用「你自己管一切」换取极致的密度和控制——一万个图元和一个图元，对画布来说都只是若干条绘制指令，没有一万个对象需要维护。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>保留模式（DOM）</th>\n<th>即时模式（Canvas/WebGL）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>你操纵的对象</td>\n<td>元素节点</td>\n<td>像素与绘制指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态保管者</td>\n<td>浏览器</td>\n<td>你的代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局/样式</td>\n<td>CSS 自动排版</td>\n<td>全部手算坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件命中</td>\n<td>内置，精确到元素</td>\n<td>自己做命中检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>自带无障碍树</td>\n<td>需手工补 ARIA / 影子 DOM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>万级动态图元</td>\n<td>崩溃</td>\n<td>从容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐像素操作</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>原生能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"canvas-与-webgl-各自解锁了什么\">Canvas 与 WebGL 各自解锁了什么</h2><p>即时模式内部还分两层能力，对应本 hub 的第二、三章。</p>\n<p><strong>Canvas 2D 解锁的是「密度」与「像素」。</strong> 它让你绕开每元素的对象开销，在一块画布上画任意数量的二维图形；更关键的是，它给了你 <code>getImageData</code>/<code>putImageData</code> 这种逐像素读写能力——DOM 里你永远拿不到「这个 div 渲染出来第 (120,80) 个像素是什么颜色」，而在 Canvas 里这是一行代码。图像滤镜、颜色拾取、生成式艺术、热力图，都建立在这层能力上。</p>\n<p><strong>WebGL 解锁的是「GPU 的并行算力」。</strong> Canvas 2D 的绘制主要仍在 CPU 侧组织（即便部分实现有 GPU 加速，你也无法直接编程 GPU）。WebGL 则把显卡的可编程管线交到你手里：成千上万个顶点由 GPU 的众多核心并行处理，每个像素的着色由你写的片元着色器决定。这是从「快一点」到「快一个数量级」的跨越，也是粒子系统、大规模数据可视化、实时后处理特效唯一可行的路径。至于这两者与更底层的 GPU 抽象如何排布，见基础章的 <a href=\"graphics-api-landscape\">API 谱系</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个量化直觉-为什么-dom-会先崩\">一个量化直觉：为什么 DOM 会先崩</h2><p>把「元素数」当自变量，DOM 与 Canvas 的成本曲线形状完全不同。DOM 每帧的近似成本可以粗略写成对参与布局与合成的节点数的累加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>DOM</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>layout</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>paint</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>composite</mtext></msub><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{DOM}} \\approx \\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\big(c_{\\text{layout}} + c_{\\text{paint}} + c_{\\text{composite}}\\big)_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DOM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">layout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paint</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2497em;vertical-align:-0.3997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">composite</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.062em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是动态节点数，每个节点都要为布局、绘制、合成付费，改动还可能触发相邻节点的连锁重排。而 Canvas 每帧成本更接近于「清屏 + 逐图元绘制」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>canvas</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>clear</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><msub><mtext>draw</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{canvas}} \\approx c_{\\text{clear}} + \\sum_{i=1}^{M} c_{\\text{draw}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">canvas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">clear</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">draw</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键差别不在求和本身，而在单项成本：Canvas 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>draw</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{draw}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">draw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一条轻量像素指令，没有布局、没有样式解析、没有合成层管理、没有无障碍树更新；DOM 的单节点成本里塞满了这些「管理税」。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 涨到几千，DOM 的管理税总额压垮 16.7ms 的帧预算（60fps 每帧只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>16.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000/60 \\approx 16.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000/60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.7</span></span></span></span></span> 毫秒），而同等规模的 Canvas 绘制往往还在预算之内。DOM 成本里那几项的具体含义，是下一篇 <a href=\"dom-ceiling\">DOM 渲染天花板</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价-你必须自己重建的东西\">代价：你必须自己重建的东西</h2><p>即时模式不是免费的午餐。放弃 DOM，等于放弃了浏览器免费提供的一整套基础设施，这些都得你自己重建：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>命中检测</strong>：画布不知道鼠标点在了哪个图元上。你要么维护一份图元的几何数据自己做点在多边形判断，要么用离屏画布的「拾取颜色」技巧。</li>\n<li><strong>无障碍</strong>：屏幕阅读器看到的只是一块空白画布。你需要在旁边维护一棵隐藏的语义 DOM，或用 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code> 的 fallback 内容描述内容。</li>\n<li><strong>文本与排版</strong>：Canvas 的文字排版能力远弱于 CSS，多行、换行、双向文本都要自己处理。</li>\n<li><strong>重绘管理</strong>：DOM 只重绘变化的部分，画布默认整屏重画，你要自己做脏矩形（dirty rectangle）或分层来避免浪费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这份「代价清单」正是选型的核心权衡：需求越接近「大量动态图元 / 逐像素 / GPU 特效」，即时模式的收益越能盖过这些代价；需求越接近「表单、文档、常规 UI」，就越该老老实实用 DOM。如何系统地做这个权衡，实践章的 <a href=\"../practice/canvas-webgl-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 会给出决策流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DOM 是保留模式：你描述对象，浏览器替你管理布局、绘制、命中、无障碍——省心，但每元素都有管理开销，万级动态元素会压垮帧预算。</li>\n<li>Canvas 与 WebGL 是即时模式：你发指令、直接落像素，画完即忘——没有对象开销，能承载极高密度与逐像素操作。</li>\n<li>Canvas 2D 解锁「密度」与「像素读写」，WebGL 解锁「GPU 并行算力」，二者是能力递进而非替代关系。</li>\n<li>选择即时模式，等于接手命中检测、无障碍、文本排版、重绘管理这些浏览器原本免费提供的活；需求是否值得付这份代价，就是选型的核心判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"dom-ceiling\">DOM 渲染天花板</a> 把本文的成本直觉拆成可量化的布局/绘制/合成三笔账；<a href=\"graphics-api-landscape\">API 谱系</a> 帮你在 Canvas 2D / WebGL / WebGPU 间选型。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：DOM 那套布局与合成的内部机制，见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">浏览器渲染内幕 · 合成</a>；帧预算与性能度量体系，见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/performance-model\">Web 性能与核心指标 · 性能模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL","id":"为何需要-canvas-与-webgl"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：即时模式与保留模式","id":"核心概念-即时模式与保留模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Canvas 与 WebGL 各自解锁了什么","id":"canvas-与-webgl-各自解锁了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"一个量化直觉：为什么 DOM 会先崩","id":"一个量化直觉-为什么-dom-会先崩"},{"level":2,"text":"代价：你必须自己重建的东西","id":"代价-你必须自己重建的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"DOM 渲染的成本天花板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/dom-ceiling"}}